{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 WD 20TB Elements Desktop External Hard Drive 帶來 Black Friday 優惠，20TB 型號入手價為 US$549.99，降價達 38%。這款桌面外接硬碟主打 20TB 大容量與 USB 3.0 隨插即用，適合集中備份相片、影片及工作檔案。若你正需要為電腦擴充儲存空間，可趁優惠期間留意實際價格。現在是值得考慮入手的時機！</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【網購優惠】WD Elements Desktop External Hard Drive 限時 62 折\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/81TLc-Xqfb-HL.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure>\n<h2>WD 20TB Elements Desktop External Hard Drive 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>20TB 大容量儲存空間：提供高達 20TB 儲存空間，適合集中存放大量相片、影片、音樂與工作備份，減少電腦內置硬碟空間不足的情況。</li>\n<li>USB 3.0 隨插即用連接：透過 USB 3.0 連接即可使用，毋須複雜設定，適合為桌上電腦或手提電腦快速增加外置儲存空間，方便日常整理檔案。</li>\n<li>桌面式外接設計：桌面外接硬碟設計適合固定放在書桌使用，為大容量檔案提供收納方案，方便日常備份與整理資料。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VCXWPQG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"WD 20TB Elements Desktop External Hard Drive, USB 3.0 drive for plug-and-play storage - WDBWLG0200HBK-NESN\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21-rcbnDXDL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VCXWPQG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WD 20TB Elements Desktop External Hard Drive, USB 3.0 drive for plug-and-play storage - WDBWLG0200HBK-NESN</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$549.99</p>\n<p>$879.99</p>\n<p>-38%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VCXWPQG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:54:31.286358+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":580,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:28:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:56:03.471912+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026